  "bio": "Davide Flowlines is an exceptionally skilled tattoo artist based in Rome, Italy, known for his intricate geometric and floral designs. His mastery of fine linework is striking, turning each tattoo into a work of art that flows with the contours of the body. Known for his professionalism, Davide ensures his workspace is always clean and respects the sanitary requirements of his craft.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Rome, Latium, Italy\n\nIn the hearth of Rome 🏛️🇮🇹 @ave_lights \nMunich/stuttgart 🇩🇪 bookings open  \nPro team @masttattoo.official\nBOOK DM “what’s app”link ⬇️",
